{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01235","headline":"相和歌辞 善哉行 · 僧贯休","name":"相和歌辞 善哉行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有美一人兮婉如清扬，识曲别音兮令姿煌煌。\n绣袂捧琴兮登君子堂，如彼萱草兮使我忧忘。\n欲赠之以紫玉尺，白银璫，久不见之兮湘水茫茫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01235.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01235","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}